            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "چوپان (chupân) گوسفندها را به کوه برد. Chupân gusfand-hâ râ be kuh bord. The shepherd took the sheep to the mountain."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Turkish çoban is the same word."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "chupân is a native word, which EtymDB lists without older forms; it is usually traced to Middle Persian šubān 'shepherd'."
